{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgHn1r7tBk3qpHFCc4u3C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fix is commit `e7052745` (\"TRUNK-6646: Env-var key normalization drops create_database_* / create_user_* credentials in scripted setup\", PR #6145, by jwnasambu). It changed `InitializationFilter` in `openmrs-core`.\n\n**Cause:** every environment variable went through `normalizeEnvVariableKey`, which turned `_` into `.` unless the key was in `NON_NORMALIZED_KEYS`. `CREATE_DATABASE_USERNAME` and `CREATE_DATABASE_PASSWORD` were not in that set, so they became `create.database.username` and `create.database.password`. The wizard then read `create_database_username` and got nothing, so it fell back to root with no password.\n\n**Fix:**\n- The whitelist now includes the create-database and create-user keys, plus `CONNECTION_DRIVER_CLASS`, `IMPORT_TEST_DATA`, the `REMOTE_*` keys and `ADMIN_PASSWORD_LOCKED` (`openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:198-202`).\n- `normalizeEnvVariableKey` keeps the underscore form for whitelisted keys and still converts the rest to dots (`InitializationFilter.java:1948-1953`).\n- The normalized keys are applied to the script properties (`InitializationFilter.java:340-343`). The create-database and create-user values are read from those keys (`InitializationFilter.java:370-385`).\n- Related changes in the same commit: the driver class also accepts `connection_driver_class` (`InitializationFilter.java:358-359`). `import_test_data` (or `add_demo_data`), `remote_*` and `admin_password_locked` are read from the resolved properties (`InitializationFilter.java:399-419`). `IMPORT_TEST_DATA` adds the import and module tasks (`InitializationFilter.java:963-966`).\n- New tests cover the key normalization (`openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterNormalizationTest.java`) and the env-var-to-wizard mapping (`openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterTest.java`, the two new tests around lines 163-241).\n\nLine numbers come from the current `HEAD` of `openmrs-core`, read through Falkon. I did not check out the repo or run the tests.\n\nSources, best first:\n- `openmrs-core` commit `e7052745fb78802c8adcd7c1962f3525e7050b1e`\n- `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java` lines 198-202, 1948-1953, 340-343, 370-385, 358-359, 399-419, 963-966\n- `openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterNormalizationTest.java`\n- `openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterTest.java`\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-core\", \"commit\": \"e7052745fb78802c8adcd7c1962f3525e7050b1e\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-core\", \"pr\": 6145},\n  {\"ticket\": \"TRUNK-6646\"},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 198, \"endLine\": 202},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 1948, \"endLine\": 1953},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 334, \"endLine\": 343},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 370, \"endLine\": 385},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 358, \"endLine\": 359},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 399, \"endLine\": 419},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 963, \"endLine\": 966},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterNormalizationTest.java\", \"startLine\": 1, \"endLine\": 92},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterTest.java\", \"startLine\": 163, \"endLine\": 241}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3019,"cache_read_input_tokens":23825,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3019},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4880cd84-9191-4491-b795-601215598815","uuid":"625a6b63-5396-4247-b616-ef213c106b6e","timestamp":"2026-10-22T18:49:51.470Z","request_id":"req_011CgHn1qtVHMYYccNJG1Ehc"}
